# Relive the Past: every target is "up to one" (CR 601.2c, 115.1b): with Bot1's sacrificed Black Lotus a legal artifact target, Bot1 chooses none, so the spell resolves and returns nothing
# (the Lotus stays in the graveyard). The sibling scenarios, which choose it, are the positive controls.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Sapphire
Relive the Past
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Relive the Past.Cast
Bot1.Target()
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Count = 4
Bot1.Graveyard = Relive the Past; Black Lotus
